    "text": "There rotten apples are mixed accidently with seven good apples and four apples are drawn one by one without replacement. Let the random variable X denote the number of rotten apples. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;represent mean and variance of X, respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
